# Every file in this package is text, and it is LF on checkout everywhere.
#
# This is here for the mirror (Thsky-21/demo), where it matters more than it
# looks. scripts/mirror-demo.ts copies these files into a clone and commits
# whatever git stages — so on a machine with core.autocrlf=true the working
# copy is CRLF, and without this file the result depends on the config of
# whoever ran the sync. One operator's sync would rewrite every line of every
# file, and the next operator's would rewrite them back. A commit that touches
# hundreds of lines to change nothing buries the one real change inside it,
# and the mirror's readability is the entire reason it exists.
*        text=auto eol=lf
